# a key held across TWO bars of a 1-bar loop. the first pass keeps the end, the next keeps going.
# a second time round used to forget the middle: playback had a hole between the release and the first press.
wait 300
tap SAVE
wait 100
turn SELECT 2
wait 100
expect track 4
expect eng 11
setbars 0 1
qnt 0
lat 0
tap PLAY
wait 200
tap REC
wait 2200
key w0 down 100
wait 4200
key w0 up
wait 200
tap REC
wait 400
dumpclip
expect events >1
expect cover >370
